db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186168581} :answer-field/id #uuid "7304f343-c0bb-5a33-8c0c-688d4eb5bda6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186168577}] :question/id #uuid "9882bc48-ffe2-5a96-827b-d1eb44c92577" :question/math-academy-id "q-124271" :question/problem "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$x = au + 4v, y =-5u + bv + c$\nis shown below. What is the value of $a + b + c$?\n$\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ -5 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix} + \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$"}]}
